@startuml 07_seq_remote_live_view
' Sequence Diagram — remote camera live view with authentication
title sd Remote login and camera live view
autonumber
actor "Resident\n(Mobile App)" as USR
participant "Cloud Identity\n(OIDC + MFA)" as AUTH
participant "Cloud Relay" as REL
participant "CCU API" as API
participant "NVR Service" as NVR
participant "IP Camera\n(PoE)" as CAM

USR -> AUTH : login(email, password)
AUTH --> USR : MFA challenge
USR -> AUTH : OTP code
alt credentials valid
  AUTH --> USR : access token (JWT, 1 h)
else invalid (5th failure)
  AUTH --> USR : account locked 15 min\n+ admin notified
end
USR -> REL : GET /cameras (Bearer token)
REL -> API : forward over TLS tunnel
API -> API : validate token, check role
API --> USR : camera list
USR -> REL : start live view (cam-02)
REL -> API : createSession(cam-02)
API -> NVR : open stream
NVR -> CAM : RTSP DESCRIBE/PLAY
CAM --> NVR : H.264/H.265 stream
NVR --> REL : WebRTC (SRTP) via TURN
REL --> USR : live video (<= 3 s to first frame)
USR -> API : stop
API -> NVR : close session, log access (audit)
@enduml
